OL,3,GNEWSATown museum repair bill could hit
OL,4,A#200k
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhitby Museum and Pannett Art Gallery
OL,7,Fcould require #200,000 of repair work
OL,8,Fto address concerns about the condition
OL,9,Fof the historic building.
OL,11,FThe figure represents a huge increase
OL,12,Fon the current #18,000 which has been
OL,13,Fallocated by the town council for
OL,14,Fgeneral repairs and maintenance of the
OL,15,Fbuilding.
OL,17,FA report to councillors said that
OL,18,F"substantial investment" was required
OL,19,Fand confirmed a series of specialist
OL,20,Fsurveys had been commissioned to
OL,21,Fidentify the scale of the work
OL,22,Frequired.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
